<!doctype html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{ .Title }}</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito+Sans:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Poppins:wght@600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/css/app.css">
</head>
<body class="dashboard-page">
  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="brand-mark light">Kala Belajar</div>
    <nav>
      <a href="/dashboard" class="active">Dashboard</a>
    </nav>
  </aside>
  <main class="dashboard-main">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">{{ .RoleLabel }}</p>
        <h1>Halo, {{ .User.Name }}</h1>
      </div>
      <form method="post" action="/logout">
        <button class="secondary" type="submit">Keluar</button>
      </form>
    </header>
    <section class="content-panel">
      <h2>Ringkasan awal</h2>
      <p class="muted">Fondasi dashboard sudah aktif. Data operasional akan muncul saat slice manajemen user, tutor, parent, dan murid disambungkan ke halaman ini.</p>
      <div class="empty-state">Belum ada aktivitas terbaru.</div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
